Hi,

The annual original artwork draw has been completed, and this year's
piece is going to another member of the list.

Thanks so much for being part of this =97 and for following the work
throughout the year. You're automatically entered into next year's
draw as well.

If the current winner doesn't respond within 48 hours, a redraw will
take place. If that happens and you're selected, I'll be in touch
directly.

Wishing you better luck next year =97 and thanks again for being here.

Louis Andrada
